{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "至尊者道，萬象光儀。可瞻可仰，為鑑為龜。歷千百世，而令名弗移。一道同風，也󲋼相維。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "雒陽白馬，東漢永平。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鄴丁，魏永平。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楊都莊嚴，齊建武"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "益州五層，魏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "益州招提，隋"}
